 "_doc": "Settings of the multi-site build (python3 site/multisite.py, output out/models/): the global page and one page per model maker, for models.agensse.com. Site part only: the fit inputs (model/, raw-data.csv, data/catalog/) are never read for these settings. Per maker: the models in legend order (base keys; the catalogue's lines — dated builds, previews, Pro modes — follow their model), the label of each key, the tag of each line, and, in `families`, each key's family, whether it is current and whether it is hidden by default. Rules: docs/DISPLAY-METHODOLOGY.md § 16.",
 "base_url": "https://models.agensse.com/",
 "out_dir": "out/models",
 "draft": "Draft: the other makers' costs are not yet put on today's prices (a price update is under way), so the cost of a non-Claude model, and every comparison that uses it, may still move.",
 "price_variants": [
  "site/price_variants.json",
  "site/price_variants.mock.json"
 ],
