  "path": "",
  "title": "AI models compared: cost vs quality across eight model makers",
  "site_name": "AI models cost vs quality",
  "description": "What the current models of Anthropic, OpenAI, Google, xAI, DeepSeek, Qwen, Zhipu (GLM) and Moonshot (Kimi) cost at every effort level, and which gives the best quality for the price. Open data, CC BY 4.0.",
  "h1": "AI models compared <span class=\"h1-line\">cost vs quality across eight makers</span>",
  "lede": "What the current model of each family, from eight model makers, actually costs at every effort level, and the quality it delivers — fused from public benchmark measurements for every (model, effort) pair, on one scale for all makers.",
